  "note": "The leading assault battalion across a water obstacle (IBB S47; IC s70-71). Plan metres from H (the click on the water, where the first wave enters at H hour: IBB S46 para 25 p240), y across to the far bank (the aim). A and B Coys cross at H on about 300 m of the bund each (IC s70 para 4c p358; the Bn front 500-800 m, IBB S46 para 22 p239) from FUPs whose start line is the water line (IBB S46 para 8 f p234), C Coy at H+20 (IC s71 para 12 p365) passing through to OBJ 2 600 m deep, D Coy in reserve; the bridge or raft site between the assault Coys, a vehicle waiting area near the water and a release point on the far bank (IC s71 para 8 p364); the Bn Assy Area not far from the obstacle, a checkpoint (IC s71 para 7 pp 362-363). With the terrain the plan is laid along the obstacle the click is on (MovementGuideWater.readWater): its width, banks and type, the crossing means and times (IBB Annex Q), the ground that observes the crossing places.",
